## 2026-11-01 — Task 4: Actions build-cost investigation

Inspected actual API job timings/logs for the three latest completed main runs with successful native-build and Park Linux jobs: 2026-10-30 and twice on 2026-10-31. Their build, Park and helper workflow files are byte-identical to the current checkout; Ubuntu24.04/Rust1.96 are unchanged. Source revisions differ: this is attribution, not a controlled before/after benchmark. Cancelled/in-progress/early-failed samples are excluded from these medians.

| Measured step | Median | Range |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Park compiler/protocol checks | 71m26s | 62m36s–76m34s |
| Cargo-reported preparation within that step | 70m21.51s | 61m19.21s–75m25.93s |
| Sum of reported libtest execution | 26.79s | 26.11s–27.25s |
| Native release compilation | 6m33s | 5m11s–51m12s |
| Release cache restore / save | 3m03s / 1m59s | 2m12s–3m10s / 1m52s–2m14s |
| Park validation-helper preparation | 10m04s | 9m59s–10m53s |

Finding: the largest observed repeated cost is Park checking/test compilation. Each log has 3,792 Checking/Compiling entries (not unique crates). Cargo preparation accounts for about 98% of the step; this is reported wall time, not compiler CPU attribution. Park's Linux job restores/saves no Cargo artifact cache and tests the source-timestamp script without applying it to restored artifacts. Nix tool/library substitution does not provide compiled project artifacts. The release job demonstrably restores its prefix-matched cache and unchanged source timestamps; unique save keys or cache-hit=false do not mean no cache was restored.

At investigation time, the candidate was compatible Park dev/test artifact reuse while preserving the commands. The later owner instruction replaces those Actions suites with compilation checks; see the consolidation report below. The API snapshot listed 12 caches totaling 9.28 GB and no binary-v2/park-validation entries; the configured quota and disappearance/eviction cause are unverified. No cache was deleted. The investigation itself changed no workflows and claimed no speedup. Main release publication preceded the Park job.

Sources: [2026-10-31 Park check](https://github.com/lince-social/lince/actions/runs/41204290581/job/124548726549), [2026-10-31 Park check](https://github.com/lince-social/lince/actions/runs/41148219014/job/124382451841), [2026-10-30 Park check](https://github.com/lince-social/lince/actions/runs/41051597656/job/124072943905). API records, logs, workflow hashes, exclusions, cache snapshot and calculated results: `target/build-iteration/actions-cost/result.json` and adjacent receipts. Task 4's investigation is complete; the later hosted cache results are recorded below.

